flowchart TD
    A[User opens app] --> B[Empty state: prompt to search]
    B --> C[User types city + submits]
    C --> D{City length >= 2?}
    D -- No --> C
    D -- Yes --> E[Loading state shown]
    E --> F[Geocode city name]
    F --> G{Found?}
    G -- No --> H[Error: City not found]
    H --> C
    G -- Yes --> I[Fetch current + 7-day forecast]
    I --> J{Success?}
    J -- No --> K[Error: network failure]
    K --> C
    J -- Yes --> L[Success: show current conditions + 7-day forecast]
    L --> C
